BT /F1 11 Tf 14 TL 50 740 Td (RoboArm X2 Installation Manual) Tj T* () Tj T* (Chapter 1. Site requirements) Tj T* (The mounting surface must support a static load of at least 2,000 N.) Tj T* (The operating temperature range is 0 to 45 degrees Celsius.) Tj T* (Relative humidity must stay below 85 percent, non-condensing.) Tj T* (Keep a free safety zone of at least 1.2 m around the arm during commissioning.) Tj T* ET
endstream
