BT /F1 11 Tf 14 TL 50 740 Td (Chapter 2. Mounting) Tj T* (The base is fixed with four M10 bolts tightened to a torque of 45 Nm.) Tj T* (The X2 can be mounted on the floor, on a table or on a wall.) Tj T* (Ceiling mounting is not supported because the joint brakes are not rated for it.) Tj T* (The controller cable between arm and controller is 5 m long.) Tj T* ET
endstream
