BT /F1 11 Tf 14 TL 50 740 Td (Chapter 3. Commissioning) Tj T* (After power-on, run the joint calibration wizard in the web dashboard.) Tj T* (The calibration wizard takes about 20 minutes and must be repeated after every collision above 150 N.) Tj T* (Set the tool weight and center of gravity before running any program.) Tj T* (The default dashboard password must be changed during commissioning.) Tj T* ET
endstream
endobj
