BT /F1 11 Tf 14 TL 50 740 Td (Chapter 4. Maintenance and error codes) Tj T* (Re-grease the joint gearboxes every 5,000 operating hours.) Tj T* (Inspect the cable harness every 6 months for wear.) Tj T* (Error code E101 indicates overcurrent in a joint motor.) Tj T* (Error code E204 indicates that the emergency stop circuit is open.) Tj T* (Error code E310 indicates a lost connection between controller and arm.) Tj T* ET
endstream
